# ant capture v2: <seconds> <device_type> <device_number> <8 payload bytes> <kind> <rssi dBm|->
# Golden vectors: every DISTINCT bike radar (0x28) payload heard on air from three
# Garmin units on 2026-11-25 (genuine third-party captures, see
# archive/captures/README.md; full sessions in archive/captures/radio/
# 2026-11-25-varia-*.antcap, sources c1-scan-radiant, c2-idle-radiant, c3-walk-radiant, c4-request-radiant, c5b-shutdown-radiant, c7-modes-radiant).
